<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Emperor Tianzuo of Liao</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1075">1075</a>–<a href="/years/1128">1128</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/12th-century">12th century</a> · Also known as Yelü Yanxi</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Emperor Tianzuo (Yelü Yanxi) was the ninth and last emperor of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/liao-dynasty">Liao dynasty</a>, reigning from 1101 to 1125. His failure to deal with the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jurchens">Jurchen</a> rising led by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/emperor-taizu-of-jin">Aguda</a> in 1114 brought defeat after defeat, and he fled into the western steppe as the Jin took his capitals. Captured by Jin forces in 1125, he died in captivity.</p></div>
